# FLOW-UP — C01 IDENTITY & OWNERSHIP RULES
## Domain Implementation Specification

**Document ID:** C01  
**Version:** 1.0  
**Layer:** C — Domain  
**Related Modules:** B01–B10  
**Related Infrastructure:** D01–D08  
**Status:** READY FOR IMPLEMENTATION — CORE SCOPE  
