## E. AI CAPABILITY

```text
AI CAPABILITY
│
├── E01. Goal Understanding & Clarification
├── E02. Goal Feasibility Feedback
├── E03. Goal Tree Proposal
├── E04. Proposal Review & Approval
└── E05. Basic Daily Plan Proposal
